  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RRi5BCA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1997\" height=\"463\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>RAR-Compat（Relics: Artifacts兼容模组）通过将Artifacts模组的机制融入Relics更复杂的分层系统中，重新定义了其玩法。这款扩展并非简单地添加随机生成的装备，而是将Artifacts物品改造适配Relics深度的等级系统，引入全新的精妙机制。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7tcUEyB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必要前置模组：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RELICS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARTIFACTS</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JrnT9d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QpQYJLy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>问：这个模组如何运作？<br></strong>答：RAR-Compat重构了现有Artifacts物品的机制以适配Relics系统。我们尽可能保持与原版机制相似，但仍有部分物品需要完全重制。</p><p><strong>问：可以在整合包中使用吗？</strong><br>答：当然可以，欢迎随意整合。</p><p><strong>问：能否转载到其他平台？</strong><br>答：禁止二次发布。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8n9CSxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/rar-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frar-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frar-compat%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frar-compat%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRelics%253a%2bArtifacts%2bCompat%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们其他模组？ - 访问<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span>获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>",
